{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q416942","formula":"Pb₃(UO₂)₈O₈(OH)₆*3H₂O","hill":"H12O33Pb3U8","elements":["H","O","Pb","U"],"composition":{"H":12.0,"O":33.0,"U":8.0,"Pb":3.0},"names":{"en":"Curite","ru":"Кюрит","uk":"Кюрит"},"descriptions":{"en":"Curite is a rare mineral with the chemical composition Pb3[(UO2)4|O4|(OH)3]2·2 H2O. It is therefore a hydrated lead uranyl oxide, which forms red needles or orange, massive aggregates.","ru":"Кюрит — минерал на основе гидратированных форм оксидов свинца и урана с общей формулой: Pb3(UO2)8O8(OH)6·3(H2O) или Pb3[(UO2)4|O4|(OH)3]2·2H2O. Впервые найден в провинции Катанга в Демократической Республике Конго и описан в 1921 году А. Скупом. Назван в честь Марии и Пьера Кюри, которые внесли существенный вклад в исследование явления радиоактивности. Известное месторождение — шахта Шинколобве.","uk":"Кюрит (рос. кюрит; англ. curite; нім."},"fame":17,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q416942","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Curite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9A%D1%8E%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9A%D1%8E%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Curit_mineralogisches_museum_bonn.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q3951207","formula":"Pb₂(UO₂)₅O₆(OH)₂*4H₂O","names":{"en":"Sayrite"},"elements":["H","O","Pb","U"],"fame":6,"kind":null},{"id":"Q3967236","formula":"Pb₃(UO₂)₆O₈(OH)₂*3